B.anm=new A.R('Serbian Cyrillic (azbuka) has 30 letters, and each one is always read the same way: "write as you speak" (Vuk Karad\u017ei\u0107). The Latin alphabet (abeceda) is used alongside it \u2014 the same 30 sounds.',null)
